OL,3,AConservatives must be ready to fight
OL,4,A'battle of ideas', Badenoch to tell
OL,5,Aparty conference
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe party has already pledged #10bn for
OL,8,Fa UK air defence system, and proposed
OL,9,Fcuts to the rate of employer National
OL,10,FInsurance contributions for those aged
OL,11,F21 to 24
OL,13,FThere is speculation that Badenoch
OL,14,Fcould propose changes to inheritance
OL,15,Ftax. According to the Times, she is due
OL,16,Fto announce a cut to the 40% rate of
OL,17,Fthe tax, which applies to an estate's
OL,18,Fvalue over #325,000, or #500,000 if a
OL,19,Fhome is passed to a direct descendent
OL,21,FYou will be able to watch the speech
OL,22,Flive above
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG4/39
