OL,5,
OL,6,FOpposition parties accuse Chief
OL,7,FElection Commissioner (CEC) Gyanesh
OL,8,FKumar of revising electoral rolls to
OL,9,Fbenefit India's governing Bharatiya
OL,10,FJanata Party (BJP). Both the BJP and
OL,11,Fthe commission have rejected the
OL,12,Fallegation.
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/39
